    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Eric Hamelin",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104436551334782098096/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUglAhRdMiGNkiFk6M2791Cg3edp-Kx4o7jq0yr_4gE8Fg1UP0=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Vanessa and Vanessa were absolutely amazing. They answered all our questions and we're super informative with suggestions about many different brands. It was like talking to old friends while getting a lesson on all the things the sqdc carries. I want to thank both of them so much for the pleasurable customer experience and I will definitely back. Thank you Vanessa and Vanessa, you girls rock.\n\nEric",
